### AiBoO API playground — VS Code REST Client (humao.rest-client)
### Click "Send Request" above each request. Install backend deps first.
### Flow: register (first user = ADMIN) → copy token into @token below → go wild.

@backend = http://localhost:4000
@agent = http://localhost:8001
@cv = http://localhost:5050

### dev keys (must match the "Backend (dev)" launch config in .vscode/launch.json)
@cvIngestKey = vscode-dev-cv-ingest-key
@agentKey = vscode-dev-agent-key

### 👤 paste the access token from the login/register response here:
@token = PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

### ─────────── AUTH ───────────

### Register — FIRST registered user becomes admin (role field ignored)
# @name reg
POST {{backend}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "VS Code Admin",
  "email": "admin@vscode.dev",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### Login
# @name login
POST {{backend}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@vscode.dev",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### Me (paste @token above first)
GET {{backend}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ─────────── CV DETECTION INGEST (machine-to-machine) ───────────

### Fire detection → dashboard red banner + critical fan-out
POST {{backend}}/api/cameras/detections
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{cvIngestKey}}

{
  "cameraId": "cam-vscode",
  "cameraName": "VS Code Cam",
  "location": "Desk",
  "type": "fire",
  "severity": "critical",
  "confidence": 0.92,
  "label": "fire"
}

### Ingest WITHOUT key → expect 401 (proves the guard)
POST {{backend}}/api/cameras/detections
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "fire" }

### ─────────── AGENT FINDINGS ───────────

### Agent pushes a finding with an IoC (203.0.113.66) → intel enrichment
POST {{backend}}/api/agent/findings
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{agentKey}}
X-Endpoint-Id: vscode-endpoint

{
  "agent_name": "CyberThreatAgent",
  "threat_type": "c2_beacon",
  "severity": "high",
  "confidence": 0.8,
  "summary": "Beaconing to 203.0.113.66 every 30s",
  "actions": ["monitor"]
}

### Recent findings
GET {{backend}}/api/agent/findings?limit=10

### Heartbeat (keeps endpoint "live" for 2 min)
POST {{backend}}/api/agent/heartbeat
X-API-Key: {{agentKey}}
X-Endpoint-Id: vscode-endpoint

### ─────────── SOAR (correlated alert → incident → approve) ───────────

### Ransomware-pattern correlated alert → creates PENDING incident
POST {{backend}}/api/agent/correlated
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "event_type": "ransomware_prelude",
  "severity": "critical",
  "description": "mass file renames + shadow copy deletion (test)",
  "entity": "HOST-VSCODE"
}

### Pending incidents (copy an _id for the approve call below)
GET {{backend}}/api/soar/incidents?status=pending
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Approve & execute (replace the id!)
POST {{backend}}/api/soar/incidents/REPLACE_WITH_ID/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List playbooks
GET {{backend}}/api/soar/playbooks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ─────────── INTEL / NOTIFICATIONS / AUDIT ───────────

### Threat-intel lookup (needs a real ABUSEIPDB_API_KEY in backend env; otherwise 'unknown')
GET {{backend}}/api/intel/lookup?ip=8.8.8.8
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Test alert through every configured channel (Slack/PagerDuty/webhook/SIEM)
POST {{backend}}/api/notifications/test
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Audit trail (last 20)
GET {{backend}}/api/audit?limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ─────────── AGENT SERVICE DIRECT (tri-gate) ───────────

### Agent health + metrics
GET {{agent}}/health
GET {{agent}}/metrics

### Push a ThreatEvent straight into the tri-gate (Gate1 → Gate2 → Gate3)
### Great for the debugging walkthrough: breakpoint in gates/gate1_perimeter.py
POST {{agent}}/events
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{agentKey}}

{
  "source": "vscode",
  "threat_type": "network_intrusion",
  "severity": "high",
  "payload": {
    "message": "port scan from 203.0.113.66",
    "entity": "HOST-VSCODE",
    "context": { "ports": [22, 3389, 445] }
  }
}

### ─────────── HEALTH ───────────

GET {{backend}}/health
GET {{agent}}/health
GET {{cv}}/health
